window.MG_LAZY_DATA["data/lazy/resources/comm-v28-141-ddb51d5fbe76be91.json"]={sha256:"ddb51d5fbe76be918b898242e9c050bc0fcc0e6f100341f696fffce1b6abf378",value:{"sources":[{"id":"v28-case-2e04d0cf568e8b45","url":"https://www.itu.int/ITU-T/recommendations/rec.aspx?lang=en&rec=16060","title":"ITU-T G.652: Characteristics of a single-mode optical fibre and cable","titleEn":"ITU-T G.652: Characteristics of a single-mode optical fibre and cable","publisher":"ITU-T","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"media":{"courses":[{"courseId":"comm-v28-141","videos":[],"guides":[]}]},"related":{"courses":[{"courseId":"comm-v28-141","related":[{"id":"comm-v28-142","referenceUrls":["https://www.itu.int/ITU-T/recommendations/rec.aspx?lang=en&rec=16037"],"title":"G.657 彎曲不敏感光纖：彎曲增量分離","titleEn":"G.657 bend-insensitive fiber: isolate bend excess loss","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：由另一學徒只使用交付檔案重建兩情境與判定；需同時保留未通過情境。 教學可用損耗上限14 dB；名義通過、變更不通過。記錄剩餘裕度，但不宣稱已量測真實鏈路。 route.csv、component_loss.csv與線性/dB交叉驗算表 保留輸入、逐項中間值、名義 12.8 與變更 14.8 dB、反例、驗收判定與模型限制，供另一學徒從零重算。 附離線證據實驗：python3 tools/curriculum-v28/labs-optical.py --lab comm-v28-141 --out ./comm-v28-141-evidence；輸出目錄必須尚不存在。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: A second apprentice must reconstruct both scenarios and decisions using only the handover files; retain failing cases as well. Teaching allowance is14 dB: nominal passes and changed fails. Report remaining margin without claiming a measured installed link. route.csv, component_loss.csv and a linear/dB cross-check table Preserve inputs, intermediate values, nominal 12.8 and changed 14.8 dB, counterexamples, acceptance decisions and model limits so another apprentice can reproduce them. Offline evidence lab: python3 tools/curriculum-v28/labs-optical.py --lab comm-v28-141 --out ./comm-v28-141-evidence; the output directory must not already exist.","difference":"完成兩組條件的可重算判定，指出哪些觀察能區分原因。 教學增量容許1.5 dB；只有0.79 mW組通過，且需恢復測試合格才能歸因彎曲。","differenceEn":"Produce reproducible decisions for both configurations and identify observations that discriminate causes. Teaching excess-loss limit1.5 dB: only the0.79 mW case passes, provided the restoration control also succeeds.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["合成路由長40 km、8個熔接各0.1 dB、2接頭各0.5 dB、預留3 dB；纖損由0.20改為0.25 dB/km。 名義式 40*0.2+8*0.1+2*0.5+3 = 12.8 dB；變更式 40*0.25+8*0.1+2*0.5+3 = 14.8 dB。逐項標示量綱，先代入未四捨五入數值再作比較。 手算名義式並保存所有中間項，實作下列獨立驗證而非只抄最終數字： 先加總元件，再把各項轉成線性傳輸率相乘，取負10log10回查；不得重複加入設計裕度。","合成直線功率1 mW，彎曲後0.79 mW；第二組0.50 mW；同一跳線且不改接頭。 名義式 10*log10(1/0.79) = 1.02373 dB；變更式 10*log10(1/0.5) = 3.0103 dB。逐項標示量綱，先代入未四捨五入數值再作比較。 手算名義式並保存所有中間項，實作下列獨立驗證而非只抄最終數字： 將彎曲恢復為直線並重讀1 mW；用相對比值消除穩定耦合損耗，再用獨立功率計核對。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["Synthetic route:40 km, eight 0.1 dB splices, two 0.5 dB connectors and 3 dB reserve; change fiber attenuation from0.20 to0.25 dB/km. Nominal 40*0.2+8*0.1+2*0.5+3 = 12.8 dB; changed 40*0.25+8*0.1+2*0.5+3 = 14.8 dB. Label dimensions, substitute unrounded values and only then compare. Calculate the nominal expression with intermediate terms and implement this independent validation rather than copying the final number: Sum components, then multiply their linear transmissions and convert back with minus10log10; apply reserve only once.","Synthetic straight reference1 mW; bent readings0.79 and0.50 mW, with the same patch cord and unchanged connectors. Nominal 10*log10(1/0.79) = 1.02373 dB; changed 10*log10(1/0.5) = 3.0103 dB. Label dimensions, substitute unrounded values and only then compare. Calculate the nominal expression with intermediate terms and implement this independent validation rather than copying the final number: Restore the straight condition and recover1 mW; use ratios to cancel stable coupling loss and cross-check with an independent power reading.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]},{"id":"comm-v28-151","referenceUrls":["https://www.itu.int/rec/T-REC-G.694.1/en"],"title":"G.694.1 彈性光網：頻槽裝箱","titleEn":"G.694.1 flex-grid: spectral-slot packing","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：由另一學徒只使用交付檔案重建兩情境與判定；需同時保留未通過情境。 教學可用損耗上限14 dB；名義通過、變更不通過。記錄剩餘裕度，但不宣稱已量測真實鏈路。 route.csv、component_loss.csv與線性/dB交叉驗算表 保留輸入、逐項中間值、名義 12.8 與變更 14.8 dB、反例、驗收判定與模型限制，供另一學徒從零重算。 附離線證據實驗：python3 tools/curriculum-v28/labs-optical.py --lab comm-v28-141 --out ./comm-v28-141-evidence；輸出目錄必須尚不存在。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: A second apprentice must reconstruct both scenarios and decisions using only the handover files; retain failing cases as well. Teaching allowance is14 dB: nominal passes and changed fails. Report remaining margin without claiming a measured installed link. route.csv, component_loss.csv and a linear/dB cross-check table Preserve inputs, intermediate values, nominal 12.8 and changed 14.8 dB, counterexamples, acceptance decisions and model limits so another apprentice can reproduce them. Offline evidence lab: python3 tools/curriculum-v28/labs-optical.py --lab comm-v28-141 --out ./comm-v28-141-evidence; the output directory must not already exist.","difference":"完成兩組條件的可重算判定，指出哪些觀察能區分原因。 教學單槽上限87.5 GHz；64 GHz訊號可排入，80 GHz組需100 GHz而拒絕原配置。","differenceEn":"Produce reproducible decisions for both configurations and identify observations that discriminate causes. Teaching allocation limit87.5 GHz:64 GHz fits, while the80 GHz case needs100 GHz and rejects the original allocation.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["合成路由長40 km、8個熔接各0.1 dB、2接頭各0.5 dB、預留3 dB；纖損由0.20改為0.25 dB/km。 名義式 40*0.2+8*0.1+2*0.5+3 = 12.8 dB；變更式 40*0.25+8*0.1+2*0.5+3 = 14.8 dB。逐項標示量綱，先代入未四捨五入數值再作比較。 手算名義式並保存所有中間項，實作下列獨立驗證而非只抄最終數字： 先加總元件，再把各項轉成線性傳輸率相乘，取負10log10回查；不得重複加入設計裕度。","合成訊號占用64 GHz、每側保護5 GHz；變更占用80 GHz，保護帶不變。 名義式 ceil((64+2*5)/12.5)*12.5 = 75 GHz；變更式 ceil((80+2*5)/12.5)*12.5 = 100 GHz。逐項標示量綱，先代入未四捨五入數值再作比較。 手算名義式並保存所有中間項，實作下列獨立驗證而非只抄最終數字： 以12.5 GHz小格畫區間並數格，檢查相鄰頻槽邊界無重疊；空餘頻寬不能忽略取整。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["Synthetic route:40 km, eight 0.1 dB splices, two 0.5 dB connectors and 3 dB reserve; change fiber attenuation from0.20 to0.25 dB/km. Nominal 40*0.2+8*0.1+2*0.5+3 = 12.8 dB; changed 40*0.25+8*0.1+2*0.5+3 = 14.8 dB. Label dimensions, substitute unrounded values and only then compare. Calculate the nominal expression with intermediate terms and implement this independent validation rather than copying the final number: Sum components, then multiply their linear transmissions and convert back with minus10log10; apply reserve only once.","Synthetic occupied bandwidth64 GHz and5 GHz guard on each side; change occupied bandwidth to80 GHz. Nominal ceil((64+2*5)/12.5)*12.5 = 75 GHz; changed ceil((80+2*5)/12.5)*12.5 = 100 GHz. Label dimensions, substitute unrounded values and only then compare. Calculate the nominal expression with intermediate terms and implement this independent validation rather than copying the final number: Draw12.5 GHz cells and count occupied intervals; check neighboring boundaries and retain rounding overhead.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]}],"references":[{"id":"v28-case-a6be448b0d5163bb","url":"https://www.itu.int/ITU-T/recommendations/rec.aspx?lang=en&rec=16037","title":"ITU-T G.657: Bending-loss insensitive single-mode optical fibre","titleEn":"ITU-T G.657: Bending-loss insensitive single-mode optical fibre","publisher":"ITU-T","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."},{"id":"v28-case-4d0106ffa0fd0a6b","url":"https://www.itu.int/rec/T-REC-G.694.1/en","title":"ITU-T G.694.1: DWDM frequency grid","titleEn":"ITU-T G.694.1: DWDM frequency grid","publisher":"ITU-T","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"overview":"比較相鄰案例與另一組案例的模型、可量測結果及可轉移的驗證方法。","overviewEn":"Compare neighboring and cross-group cases by model, measurable outcome, and transferable verification method."}]},"places":{"courses":[]},"vendors":{"courses":[],"vendors":[]}}};
